### Récupérer toutes les commandes
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/orders


### Valider une commande
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/admin/orders/32/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "validated"
}


### Annuler une commande
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/admin/orders/32/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "cancelled"
}


### Refuser le retour au statut pending
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/admin/orders/32/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "pending"
}


### Refuser un identifiant inexistant
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/admin/orders/99999999/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "validated"
}


### Refuser un identifiant invalide
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/admin/orders/bonjour/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "validated"
}